TFLCoMentor is an online learning, mentoring, assessment, and recruitment platform that connects students, mentors, SMEs (Subject Matter Experts), and employers.



1️⃣ Admin Dashboard

Admin manages and monitors the entire platform.

Main responsibilities:

View platform statistics and activity

Manage assessments

Assign assessments to students

Track student participation and results

View platform session logs

Manage users and roles

Remove inactive users



2️⃣ Student Dashboard

Student uses the platform for learning, testing, and job opportunities.

Main responsibilities:

Manage profile and password

View courses, assignments, and labs

Submit assignments and projects

Take assessments and view results

Communicate with mentors

Participate in discussion forums

Apply for jobs and track applications

Monitor learning progress and notifications



3️⃣ SME Dashboard

SME creates learning content and assessments.

Main responsibilities:

Create and manage learning sessions

Create hands-on practice activities

Manage concepts and topics

Manage programming runtimes

Create and manage tests

Manage question bank

Submit questions for mentor review

Analyze assessment results and student performance



4️⃣ Mentor Dashboard

Mentor guides and monitors student learning progress.

Main responsibilities:

Manage assigned students

Track student progress and skills

Review assignments and projects

Provide feedback and mentoring notes

Conduct mentoring sessions

Access learning resources

Manage mentor profile

5️⃣ Employer Dashbord

Employer handles recruitment and hiring.

Main responsibilities:

Manage company profile

Post and manage job openings

View and search candidates

Review job applications

Shortlist candidates

Conduct interviews

View interview results

Hire qualified candidates




